label ep6_25:
    scene black with ns
    pause 0.5
    scene schoolday with ns
    play music mightcry volume 0.25
    "最后一场考试结束时，走廊里渐渐安静下来。"
    "我把笔放回笔袋，收好桌上的资料。"
    "交卷的人陆续走出考场。"
    "有人约着去吃饭，也有人打算直接回宿舍。"
    "我站在教学楼外，手机上多了几条消息。"
    "社团群里有人发了学期末的合照。"
    "下面很快多了几个表情。"
    "我看着照片里熟悉的面孔。"
    "这学期过得比想象中快。"
    "有些日子忙得顾不上回想。"
    "有些片刻却记得很清楚。"
    "那些一起走过的路、说过的话，"
    "还有每次做出选择时的心情，"
    "都留在了这个学期里。"
    $ ep6_top_score = max(aff_lkc, aff_ljq, aff_wht, aff_wzh)
    $ ep6_top_count = (1 if aff_lkc == ep6_top_score else 0) + (1 if aff_ljq == ep6_top_score else 0) + (1 if aff_wht == ep6_top_score else 0) + (1 if aff_wzh == ep6_top_score else 0)
    $ ep6_is_super_harem = aff_lkc >= 5 and aff_ljq >= 5 and aff_wht >= 5 and aff_wzh >= 5
    if ep6_is_super_harem:
        jump ep6_25_super_harem
    elif ep6_top_score < 3:
        jump ep6_25_single
    elif ep6_top_count > 1:
        jump ep6_25_harem
    # 表白后移到各条个人线的 28 节，25 节只做分流。
    elif aff_wzh == ep6_top_score:
        jump ep7_wzh_entry
    elif aff_lkc == ep6_top_score:
        jump ep7_lkc_entry
    elif aff_ljq == ep6_top_score:
        jump ep7_ljq_entry
    else:
        jump ep7_wht_entry

